 een from Budapest\, HU.\nThe Moon is 11° up in the SE · daylight\, Sun +
 44°.\nTimes for the Moon's mean limb\, ±2 s.\nMap\, timings and the view
  at the Moon's edge: https://occult.alokm.com/venus-2026-09-14?lat=47.4984
 &lon=19.0404
